docs {
  ## Update Report Type — PUT /documentation/report-types/:id

  Send only the fields that changed. `states`, when sent, **replaces** the
  type's whole state list (send `[]` to remove it from every state).

  ### Request body (all optional)

  | Field     | Type     | Notes                         |
  |-----------|----------|-------------------------------|
  | name      | string   |                               |
  | sortOrder | int      |                               |
  | states    | string[] | replaces the full state list  |
  | isActive  | int      | `1`/`0`                       |

  ### Response (200)
  Same shape as `GET /documentation/report-types/:id`. `404` if not found.
}
